      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "This paper provides an overview of issues relating to pain assessment and management. Areas to be covered include the problems involved in assessing pain as a subjective phenomenon, the constraints of assessment within the clinical field, factors that affect pain, and pain assessment tools and questionnaires. The aim of the reference list is to provide back-up reading to assist in exploring the options available when considering the possibility of compiling a pain assessment protocol for individual clinical areas."},
